WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.424
Compare lessons of sacred passages and oral traditions respectfully

00:00:05.283 --> 00:00:10.132
Prayer: a way believers speak or communicate with God. Worship: acts expressing

00:00:10.132 --> 00:00:12.153
devotion in a religious tradition.

00:00:13.033 --> 00:00:18.132
Charity: help given to people in need. Tolerance: respected coexistence with people

00:00:18.132 --> 00:00:22.806
of different beliefs. Reflection: thinking carefully about your own actions and

00:00:22.806 --> 00:00:23.231
values.

00:00:24.033 --> 00:00:28.065
Write two ways to show respect when visiting someone else’s religious setting.
